{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-p014a","title":"曹操禁绝济南祠祀","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-p014a-account","label":"《魏书》","text":"《魏书》补述曹操举免贪吏、毁坏祠屋，禁止官民祠祀的经过。","evidence":["wudi-e-p014a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"禁祀整治","evidence":["wudi-e-p014a-q"]}],"place":{"text":"济南","evidence":["wudi-e-p014a-q"]},"time":{"label":"任济南相时","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据所在段落机械补定年份。","evidence":["wudi-e-p014a-q"]},"source_order":[1,56,"P014a"],"order":31}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-e-p014a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-69b364faeccecf60f439","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《魏书》曰：“长吏受取贪饕，依倚贵势，历前相不见举闻。太祖至，咸皆举免。小大震怖，奸宄遁逃，窜入他郡；政教大行，一郡清平。初，城阳景王刘章以有功于汉，故其国为立祠。青州诸郡转相仿效，济南尤盛，至六百余祠；贾人或假二千石舆服导从作倡乐，奢侈日甚，民坐贫穷：历世长吏无敢禁绝者。太祖到，皆毁坏祠屋，止绝官吏民不得祠祀。及至秉政，遂除奸邪鬼神之事，世之淫祀由此遂绝。”","attribution":"《魏书》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":55,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-e9d846cb6df2afc5e2da","start":0,"end":184,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
